<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.27% (Discount)	  C/S =  1.27%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.27% (Discount)	  O/N =  1.27%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27% (Discount)	  T/N =  1.27%</p>
<p>		   Jan  28, 1997			Jan 27, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.72%	1 month forward =  3.73%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  4.92%	2 month forward =  5.26%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.22%	3 month forward =  6.45%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.53%	4 month forward =  6.70%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.86%	5 month forward =  7.06%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.03%	6 month forward =  7.14%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
